without your goons
having a firefight in an embassy.

807
00:43:33.780 --> 00:43:35.365
But I suppose that's why. yeah?

808
00:43:36.033 --> 00:43:38.160
Yeah. y-you wanna bury the fact that she…

809
00:43:38.243 --> 00:43:40.954
she batted her eyelids
and you let her walk out of the building

810
00:43:41.038 --> 00:43:44.499
