813
00:43:50.380 --> 00:43:51.924
Yeah. I'm sure you do.

814
00:43:52.007 --> 00:43:53.050
Yeah. let me guess.

815
00:43:53.133 --> 00:43:58.805
Judd gets to keep the commission on
the hundred mil for saying that. um. he…

816
00:43:58.889 --> 00:44:03.560
