Yeah. well. it looks like I'm fucked.

823
00:44:17.783 --> 00:44:20.827
You know. I don't like to use that word.
but yes. You're fucked.

824
00:44:20.911 --> 00:44:22.454
You're all totally fucked.

825
00:44:22.538 --> 00:44:26.750
Fucked. [chuckles] Apart from Cartwright.
because he shows some promise. I feel.

826
00:44:26.834 --> 00:44:30.379
- and deserves a second chance.
- Oh. he'll only balls it up.

827
00:44:31.547 --> 00:44:33.507
Right. Well. I'll see myself out. shall I?

828
00:44:34.007 --> 00:44:35.384
[chuckles] Oh. by the way.

829
