What was what?

838
00:45:15.174 --> 00:45:18.385
- That… [stammers] I overheard. um…
- Oh. that.

839
00:45:18.468 --> 00:45:20.345
Uh… Yeah.

840
00:45:20.429 --> 00:45:24.016
That was you
threatening a political figure

841
